        },
        {
          "text": "Bakali kusambala zyamalebaleba, azikobela zyakamwemvwe azyamanyengwe manyengwe, amasasa aamabala mabala aatungidwe kabotu. Ezi zyoonse bakali kuuzya nzizyo. ",
